7aboir <7aboir@lebarducoin.fr> wrote:
> I just noticed in my current unnethack game on the official server that all 
> of the three vailable items on top of sokoban (amulet of reflection, bag of 
> holding, and cloak of displacement in this game) are auto-identified, while 
> none of these were encountered before (as I can still see in \).
> I do not remember that this was the case before (but I may be wrong) and 
> just wonder if it is by-design (and in this case what is behind this 
> design).

Yes, it's by design.

As there are now several different objects possible as the sokoban
prize the player wouldn't be able to make an informed decision if he
only saw a cloak, an amulet and a bag.

As soon as the prize is picked up, it will be made known to you,
although the two "lost" prizes won't.

Maybe that's something that could be changed? You see them and so you
should be able to recognize such objects later. It would be more
consistent.

